RootHide libkrw provider source snapshot

Source: Relaxin commit 88548b8033a0302536321206bd2d1411772cd031 (Lessica/Relaxin).
The provider and libjailbreak ABI headers are from the same committed snapshot.
Original paths: Vendor/Dopamine/Packages/libkrw-provider/src/main.c,
Vendor/Dopamine/BaseBin/libjailbreak/src/{primitives.h,primitives_external.h,info.h,primitives_IOSurface.h},
and Vendor/Dopamine/BaseBin/_external/include/libkrw/libkrw_plugin.h.

Keep these headers paired with the runtime; ordinary Dopamine 2 headers have a
different kernel_primitives layout and system_info layout. This source subset
is embedded so building does not require a local Relaxin checkout or an
unpublished remote revision. The build patch only narrows umbrella includes.
The libjailbreak.tbd is a link interface for the runtime supplied by Relaxin,
not a replacement runtime.
